---

## 🗂 Storage Lifecycle

- On startup → `loadOwnedCards()` loads from `localStorage`
- On catch/reset → `saveOwnedCards()` writes to `localStorage`
- Viewer/overview/pokedex screens update immediately

---

## 🎯 Catch Logic Summary

1. Find unowned cards  
2. Pick one at random  
3. Mark it owned  
4. Save to `localStorage`  
5. Show modal  
6. Refresh viewer after modal closes  

---

## 🧹 Reset Logic Summary

1. Confirm reset  
2. Remove all owned keys for the current collection  
3. Save to `localStorage`  
4. Refresh viewer  

---

## 🖼 Modal Logic Summary

- Opens when clicking a card  
- Shows front image if owned  
- Shows cardback if unowned  
- Displays rarity icon + text  
- Applies rarity border color  
- Supports pinch‑zoom  
- Closes with ✖  
- Refreshes viewer if catch was used  

